<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="vi">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>Bài tập 5: Trình bày các mẫu</title>
    <style>
        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            padding: 30px;
            background-color: white;
            color: #333;
        }

        h1 {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 20px;
        }

        h2 {
            color: #b30000;
            font-size: 15px;
        }

        .section {
            margin-bottom: 60px;
        }

        /* ================= BÀI 1 : wireframe overlay ================= */
        .wire-wrap {
            width: 600px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .wire-nav {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #c0475a, #d97a86);
            color: #fff;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: space-between;
            padding: 10px 15px;
        }

            .wire-nav .links {
                display: flex;
                gap: 18px;
                font-size: 10px;
                letter-spacing: 1px;
                opacity: .85;
            }

            .wire-nav .label {
                font-weight: bold;
                font-size: 16px;
                letter-spacing: 1px;
            }

        .wire-header {
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #4a4a8f, #6a6aad 60%, #7f8fc9);
            color: #fff;
            padding: 25px 15px 35px;
            position: relative;
        }

            .wire-header .label {
                text-align: center;
                font-weight: bold;
                font-size: 18px;
            }

            .wire-header .logo {
                position: absolute;
                right: 15px;
                bottom: 8px;
                font-style: italic;
                font-size: 15px;
                opacity: .7;
            }

        .wire-body {
            display: flex;
        }

        .wire-content {
            background: #8fbf3f;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.85);
            flex: 2.2;
            padding: 15px;
            position: relative;
            min-height: 190px;
        }

            .wire-content .fake-text {
                font-size: 10px;
                line-height: 1.4;
                opacity: .6;
            }

                .wire-content .fake-text b {
                    display: block;
                    margin-top: 8px;
                }

            .wire-content .label {
                position: absolute;
                left: 50%;
                top: 50%;
                transform: translate(-50%,-50%);
                font-weight: bold;
                font-size: 20px;
                color: #fff;
            }

        .wire-sidebar {
            background: #4d6b1f;
            color: rgba(255,255,255,.85);
            flex: 1;
            padding: 15px;
            position: relative;
            min-height: 190px;
        }

            .wire-sidebar .fake-text {
                font-size: 10px;
                line-height: 1.4;
                opacity: .6;
            }

            .wire-sidebar .label {
                position: absolute;
                left: 50%;
                top: 50%;
                transform: translate(-50%,-50%);
                font-weight: bold;
                font-size: 18px;
                color: #fff;
                white-space: nowrap;
            }

        .wire-footer {
            background: #c4841f;
            color: #fff;
            text-align: center;
            font-weight: bold;
            padding: 12px;
            font-size: 16px;
        }

        /* ================= BÀI 2 : real design ================= */
        .site-wrap {
            width: 600px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .site-nav {
            background: #1a1a1a;
            display: flex;
        }

            .site-nav div {
                padding: 10px 18px;
                color: #ccc;
                font-size: 11px;
                letter-spacing: .5px;
            }

                .site-nav div.active {
                    background: #e07b1e;
                    color: #fff;
                }

        .site-header {
            height: 110px;
            background: linear-gradient(120deg, #caa06a, #8a5a35);
            position: relative;
        }

            .site-header .strip {
                position: absolute;
                bottom: 0;
                right: 0;
                background: #111;
                color: #fff;
                padding: 8px 14px;
                font-style: italic;
                font-size: 15px;
            }

        .site-content {
            display: flex;
            padding: 15px 20px;
            gap: 25px;
        }

        .site-col {
            flex: 1;
        }

            .site-col h3 {
                color: #e07b1e;
                font-size: 13px;
                margin-bottom: 4px;
            }

            .site-col p {
                font-size: 11px;
                line-height: 1.5;
                margin: 4px 0;
            }

            .site-col a {
                color: #2255aa;
            }

            .site-col .item {
                margin-bottom: 10px;
            }

                .site-col .item .name {
                    font-weight: bold;
                    font-size: 11.5px;
                }

        .site-footer {
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 10px;
            color: #999;
            border-top: 1px solid #eee;
            padding: 8px;
        }

        /* ================= BÀI 3 : three column layout ================= */
        .three-wrap {
            width: 650px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

        .three-body {
            display: flex;
        }

        .three-left {
            background: #fdfbc9;
            width: 150px;
            padding: 14px;
            border-right: 1px solid #e5e2a0;
        }

            .three-left h4 {
                margin: 0 0 8px;
                font-size: 13px;
            }

            .three-left a {
                display: block;
                color: #4444cc;
                text-decoration: underline;
                font-size: 11.5px;
                margin-bottom: 4px;
            }

            .three-left .gap {
                height: 10px;
            }

        .three-center {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 14px 18px;
        }

            .three-center h1.title {
                font-size: 18px;
                margin: 0 0 8px;
            }

            .three-center p {
                font-size: 11.5px;
                line-height: 1.5;
                margin: 6px 0;
            }

            .three-center h2.sub {
                font-size: 14px;
                margin: 14px 0 4px;
            }

            .three-center a {
                color: #4444cc;
            }

        .cc-badge {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #003399;
            color: #fff;
            font-size: 9px;
            padding: 3px 6px;
            margin: 6px 0;
        }

        .photo-placeholder {
            width: 90px;
            height: 70px;
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#ddd,#ddd 4px,#eee 4px,#eee 8px);
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 9px;
            color: #999;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .three-right {
            width: 130px;
            padding: 14px;
            border-left: 1px solid #e0b0b0;
        }

            .three-right .box {
                background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#f3c9c9,#f3c9c9 5px,#f7dede 5px,#f7dede 10px);
                border: 2px solid #cc7a7a;
                padding: 10px;
                font-size: 11px;
                font-weight: bold;
                text-align: center;
            }

        .three-footer {
            background: repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#f3c9c9,#f3c9c9 5px,#f7dede 5px,#f7dede 10px);
            border-top: 2px solid #cc7a7a;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 10px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 12px;
        }

            .three-footer a {
                color: #333;
            }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <h1><u>Bài tập 5 : Trình bày các mẫu</u></h1>

    <!-- ================= BÀI 1 ================= -->
    <div class="section">
        <h2><u>Bài 1 :</u></h2>
        <div class="wire-wrap">
            <div class="wire-nav">
                <div class="links"><span>ABOUT</span><span>SERVICES</span><span>PORTFOLIO</span><span>CONTACT</span></div>
                <div class="label">MAIN MENU</div>
            </div>
            <div class="wire-header">
                <div class="label">HEADER</div>
                <div class="logo">enlighten designs</div>
            </div>
            <div class="wire-body">
                <div class="wire-content">
                    <div class="fake-text">
                        Enlighten Designs is an internet solutions provider that specialises in front
                        and back end development.
                        <b>CONTACT US</b>
                        Phone: (07) 000 0000<br>Fax: (07) 000 0000<br>Email: info@enlighten.co.nz
                    </div>
                    <div class="label">CONTENT</div>
                </div>
                <div class="wire-sidebar">
                    <div class="fake-text">
                        FEATURED PROJECTS<br>
                        The New Zealand National Party<br>
                        Greensets<br>
                        Nutrition Care
                    </div>
                    <div class="label">SIDE BAR</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="wire-footer">FOOTER</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ================= BÀI 2 ================= -->
    <div class="section">
        <h2><u>Bài 2 :</u></h2>
        <div class="site-wrap">
            <div class="site-nav">
                <div class="active">ABOUT</div>
                <div>SERVICES</div>
                <div>PORTFOLIO</div>
                <div>CONTACT US</div>
            </div>
            <div class="site-header">
                <div class="strip">enlighten designs</div>
            </div>
            <div class="site-content">
                <div class="site-col">
                    <h3>ABOUT</h3>
                    <p>Enlighten Designs is an internet solutions provider that specialises in front and back end development. To view some of the web sites we have created see our <a href="#">portfolio</a>.</p>
                    <p>We are currently designing a face-lift, so if you have any questions or would like more information about the services we provide please feel free to contact us.</p>
                    <h3 style="margin-top:14px;">CONTACT US</h3>
                    <p>
                        Phone:&nbsp;&nbsp;(07) 000 0000<br>
                        Fax:&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;(07) 000 0000<br>
                        Email:&nbsp;<a href="#">info@enlighten.co.nz</a><br>
                        P.O. Box: 000, Hamilton, New Zealand
                    </p>
                    <p><a href="#">More contact information.</a></p>
                </div>
                <div class="site-col">
                    <h3>FEATURED PROJECTS</h3>
                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="name">The New Zealand National Party</div>
                        <p>We recently launched the <a href="#">New Zealand National Party</a> website. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, this is placeholder text.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="name">Greensets</div>
                        <p>We recently launched the <a href="#">Greensets</a> website. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, placeholder text.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="item">
                        <div class="name">Nutrition Care</div>
                        <p>We recently launched the <a href="#">Nutrition Care</a> website. Lorem ipsum dolor sit amet, placeholder text.</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="site-footer">Copyright &copy; Enlighten Designs &nbsp;|&nbsp; About &nbsp;|&nbsp; Services &nbsp;|&nbsp; Portfolio &nbsp;|&nbsp; Contact Us</div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- ================= BÀI 3 ================= -->
    <div class="section">
        <h2><u>Bài 3 :</u></h2>
        <div class="three-wrap">
            <div class="three-body">
                <div class="three-left">
                    <h4>Templates</h4>
                    <a href="#">Left Column</a>
                    <a href="#">Right Column</a>
                    <a href="#">Top &amp; Right</a>
                    <a href="#">3 Column</a>
                    <a href="#">3 Column &amp; Footer</a>
                    <div class="gap"></div>
                    <a href="#">Threaded</a>
                    <a href="#">Threaded Item</a>
                    <a href="#">Unthreaded</a>
                    <div class="gap"></div>
                    <a href="#">prosandcons1</a>
                    <a href="#">prosandcons2</a>
                    <a href="#">spider1</a>
                </div>
                <div class="three-center">
                    <h1 class="title">Three Column Layout with Footer</h1>
                    <p>This layout demonstrates a three column layout with a bottom footer stretching the width of the page. The left and right columns are positioned absolutely and the central column (this main body of text) is given very large margins to accommodate the width of the side columns.</p>
                    <p>The footer is positioned along the bottom of the page. Some CSS properties attached to various elements of the page ensure that it is always at the bottom of the view port or of the document, whichever is "lower". This is based on an <a href="#">interesting CSS technique</a>.</p>
